          "book": "LAM",
          "chapter": 5,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "Remember, LORD, what has come on us. Look, and see our reproach.",
      "ko": "여호와여 우리의 당한 것을 기억하시고 우리의 수욕을 감찰하옵소서",
      "source_text_hash": "0f7e87c5ce3392a859cf2ca036260bd891a1542fe027ff2a2b5d08271ce7dafd",
      "translation_text_hash": "36e89c17377c9317c69bc37fc58c34b4f6b154c0b4a8aefe9bb5b2fbb64ce3dd",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
